# Sepet Uctan Uca Denetimi

Bu rapor "'`sepet/` altindaki kaynak dosyalari okunarak hazirlandi. Calisma yalnizca denetim amacli yapildi; kaynak dosyalar degistirilmedi. Atiflar depo kokune gore `dosya:satir` bicimindedir.

## 1. Modul Haritasi

| Python modulu | Sorumluluk | Okudugu tablolar | Yazdigi tablolar |
|---|---|---|---|
| `sepet/api/accounts.py` | Musteri/restoran kaydi, giris, oturum tokeni uretimi, kullanici bilgisi ve cuzdan bakiyesi yukleme. | `user` dogrudan; `auth_token` ve `user` `get_current_user` zinciri uzerinden (`sepet/api/accounts.py:7-8`, `63-68`, `92-98`, `110-123`). | `user`, `restaurant`, `auth_token` (`sepet/api/accounts.py:65-85`, `50-56`, `116-119`). |
| `sepet/api/auth.py` | Bearer tokenini cozumler, zorunlu/opsiyonel kimlik ve `customer`, `restaurant`, `courier` rolu guardlarini saglar. | `auth_token`, `user`, `restaurant`, `courier` (`sepet/api/auth.py:6-20`, `42-45`, `54-57`). | Tablo yazmaz. |
| `sepet/api/db.py` | SQLite yolunu ve baglantisini acar; satir erisimini, UTC zamanini ve PBKDF2 sifre dogrulamasini saglar. | Tablo erisimi yok (`sepet/api/db.py:8-14`). | Tablo yazmaz. |
| `sepet/api/main.py` | FastAPI uygulamasini kurar, routerlari baglar; restoran/mutfak/siparis gibi genel API endpointlerini icerir. | `restaurant`, `restaurant_review`, `menu_item`, `order`, `order_item`; kimlik guardlari uzerinden `auth_token` ve `user` (`sepet/api/main.py:44-54`, `85-115`, `122-136`, `149-161`). | `user`, `order`, `order_item` (`sepet/api/main.py:181-212`). |
| `sepet/api/panels.py` | Siparis serilestirme, musteri gecmisi, restoran siparis/menü/kurye kazanc yonetimi, kurye akisi ve teslimat onayi. | `order`, `order_item`, `restaurant`, `courier`, `user`; guardlar uzerinden `auth_token` (`sepet/api/panels.py:35-65`, `70-103`, `110-125`, `169-204`, `212-232`, `251-263`). | `user`, `courier`, `menu_item`, `order` (`sepet/api/panels.py:136-144`, `152-156`, `182-185`, `219-221`, `237-239`). |
| `sepet/api/reviews.py` | Onayli siparis sahiplerinin restoran yorumu vermesini ve goruntulenen puanin hesaplanmasini saglar. | `restaurant`, `order`, `restaurant_review`; guard uzerinden `auth_token` ve `user` (`sepet/api/reviews.py:13-15`, `27-43`). | `restaurant_review` (`sepet/api/reviews.py:44-49`). |
| `sepet/api/seed.py` | Var olan SQLite dosyasini siler, `schema.sql` ile sifirdan kurar ve demo restoran, kullanici, kurye verisi olusturur. | `restaurant` (`sepet/api/seed.py:200-206`). | `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `user`, `courier` (`sepet/api/seed.py:164-227`). |

`schema.sql` Python modulu degil, uygulamanin yapisal kontratidir. Sekiz tabloyu tanimlar: `sepet/api/schema.sql:1-76`.

## 2. Bagliliklar

- `accounts.py -> auth.py`: `get_current_user` importu, token tabanli kimlik guardlari icin kullaniliyor: `sepet/api/accounts.py:7`, `101-119`.
- `accounts.py -> db.py`: `get_db`, sifre hashleme, sifre dogrulama ve UTC zaman fonksiyonlari: `sepet/api/accounts.py:8`.
- `auth.py -> db.py`: Bearer tokenini veritabaninda cozmek icin `get_db`: `sepet/api/auth.py:3`, `18-20`.
- `main.py -> accounts.py`: auth routerini uygulamaya eklemek icin: `sepet/api/main.py:7`, `15`.
- `main.py -> auth.py`: optional/customer kimlik bagimliliklari: `sepet/api/main.py:8`, `83`, `143`.
- `main.py -> db.py`: ana endpointlerin veritabani erisimi: `sepet/api/main.py:9`, `47`, `75`, `84`, `121`, `149`.
- `main.py -> panels.py`: panel routerini uygulamaya eklemek icin: `sepet/api/main.py:10`, `16`.
- `main.py -> reviews.py`: review routerini eklemek ve restoran puanlarini hesaplamak icin: `sepet/api/main.py:11`, `17`, `59`, `103`.
- `panels.py -> auth.py`: `require_customer`, `require_restaurant`, `require_courier` guardlari: `sepet/api/panels.py:6`.
- `panels.py -> db.py`: panel verisi, sifre hashleme ve UTC zaman erisimi: `sepet/api/panels.py:7`.
- `reviews.py -> auth.py`: musteri kimligi zorunlulugu: `sepet/api/reviews.py:5`, `22`.
- `reviews.py -> db.py`: yorum dogrulama ve ekleme: `sepet/api/reviews.py:6`, `26-49`.
- `reviews.py -> panels.py`: `ReviewInput` modelinin yeniden kullanimi: `sepet/api/reviews.py:7`, `21`.
- `seed.py -> db.py`: demo sifre hashleme ve zaman uretimi: `sepet/api/seed.py:4`, `193-194`.

Router baglantisi sonucunda olusan calisma zamani bagimliligi: `main.py` `accounts_router` ve `panels_router`'"'i "'`reviews_router`'"'dan once ekliyor: "'`sepet/api/main.py:15-17`. Bu siralama `GET /api/orders/history` route'"'unun "'`GET /api/orders/{order_id}` tarafindan gizlenmemesini sagliyor: `sepet/api/panels.py:68`, `sepet/api/main.py:15-17`, `119`.

## 3. Request Yasam Dongusu

Ortak kimlik zinciri su sekilde ilerler: FastAPI dependency olarak `resolve_user` cagrilir; `Authorization` headerini okur, `get_db` ile baglanti acar ve `_user_from_token` icinde `auth_token` ile `user` tablolarini JOIN eder: `sepet/api/auth.py:6-20`. `get_current_user` kullanici yoksa 401 dondurur: `sepet/api/auth.py:23-26`. `require_customer` rol kontrolu yapar: `sepet/api/auth.py:33-36`. `require_restaurant` once rol kontrolu yapar, sonra ayri bir baglantiyla `restaurant` arar: `sepet/api/auth.py:39-48`. `require_courier` da ayri baglantiyla `courier` arar: `sepet/api/auth.py:51-60`.

| Endpoint | Route handler -> veritabani -> yanit |
|---|---|
| `POST /api/auth/register` | `register` -> `validate_registration` -> `validate_email` -> `get_db` -> `user` e-posta kontrolu -> `user` ekleme -> restoran hesabinda `restaurant` ekleme -> `issue_token` ile `auth_token` ekleme -> token/user dondurur: `sepet/api/accounts.py:59-86`. |
| `POST /api/auth/login` | `login` -> `get_db` -> `user` e-posta sorgusu -> `verify_password` -> `issue_token` ile `auth_token` yazimi -> token/user dondurur: `sepet/api/accounts.py:89-98`; sifre dogrulama `sepet/api/db.py:27-32`. |
| `GET /api/auth/me` | `me` -> `get_current_user` -> `resolve_user` -> `_user_from_token` -> `auth_token JOIN user` -> `user_payload` ile bakiye/user dondurur: `sepet/api/accounts.py:101-103`; `sepet/api/auth.py:6-26`; `sepet/api/accounts.py:31-32`. |
| `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` | `top_up_wallet` -> `get_current_user` zinciri -> rol kontrolu -> `user.balance` UPDATE -> ayni tablodan yeni bakiye SELECT -> bakiye/eklenen tutar dondurur: `sepet/api/accounts.py:110-123`. |
| `GET /api/restaurants` | `list_restaurants` -> dinamik WHERE ile `restaurant` SELECT -> tum `restaurant_review` ortalamasi -> `displayed_rating` ile puan guncelleme -> Python tarafinda filtre/siralama -> liste dondurur: `sepet/api/main.py:33-70`; `sepet/api/reviews.py:13-15`. |
| `GET /api/cuisines` | `list_cuisines` -> `restaurant.cuisine` DISTINCT SELECT -> string listesi dondurur: `sepet/api/main.py:73-79`. |
| `GET /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}` | `get_restaurant` -> `get_optional_user` zinciri -> `restaurant`, `menu_item`, `restaurant_review JOIN user` sorgulari -> `displayed_rating` -> musteri ise `order` ve `restaurant_review` yetki/yorum kontrolu -> restoran/menu/yorum dondurur: `sepet/api/main.py:82-116`. |
| `GET /api/orders/{order_id}` | `get_order` -> kimlik/ownership guardi yok -> `order JOIN restaurant` -> `order_item` listesi -> siparis ve satirlari dondurur: `sepet/api/main.py:119-139`. |
| `POST /api/orders` | `create_order` -> `require_customer` -> bos/rol kontrolleri -> `restaurant` SELECT -> `menu_item` SELECT -> minimum tutar ve bakiye kontrolu -> `user.balance` UPDATE -> `order` INSERT -> her satir icin `order_item` INSERT -> id/status/total dondurur: `sepet/api/main.py:142-214`. |
| `GET /api/orders/history` | `order_history` -> `require_customer` -> musteriye ait `order JOIN restaurant/user/courier` SELECT -> `serialize_orders` her siparis icin `order_item` sorgusu -> liste dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:68-81`, `35-49`. |
| `GET /api/restaurant/orders` | `restaurant_orders` -> `require_restaurant` -> restorana ait `order` JOIN sorgusu, opsiyonel status filtresi -> `serialize_orders` -> `order_item` listeleri -> liste dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:84-103`. |
| `GET /api/restaurant/couriers` | `list_couriers` -> `require_restaurant` -> `courier WHERE restaurant_id` SELECT -> id/name/user_id dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:106-114`. |
| `GET /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `list_menu_items` -> `require_restaurant` -> restoranin `menu_item` listesini SELECT eder -> liste dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:117-125`. |
| `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` | `create_courier` -> `require_restaurant` -> isim kontrolu -> `user` e-posta kontrolu -> `user` INSERT -> `courier` INSERT -> yeni kurye dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:128-145`. |
| `POST /api/restaurant/menu-items` | `add_menu_item` -> `require_restaurant` -> `menu_item` INSERT -> yeni urun dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:148-157`. |
| `POST /api/restaurant/orders/{order_id}/assign-courier` | `assign_courier` -> `require_restaurant` -> `order` SELECT ve restoran sahipligi -> status `hazırlanıyor` kontrolu -> `courier` SELECT ve restorana aidiyet -> `order` UPDATE (`kuryede`) -> status/kurye adi dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:160-187`. |
| `GET /api/courier/orders` | `courier_orders` -> `require_courier` -> `order JOIN restaurant/user/courier WHERE courier_id` SELECT -> `serialize_orders` ile `order_item` ekleme -> liste dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:190-204`. |
| `POST /api/courier/orders/{order_id}/deliver` | `deliver_order` -> `require_courier` -> `order` SELECT ve kurye sahipligi -> status `kuryede` kontrolu -> `order` UPDATE (`teslim_edildi`, `delivered_at`) -> status dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:207-223`. |
| `POST /api/orders/{order_id}/confirm_delivery` | `confirm_delivery` -> `require_customer` -> `order` SELECT ve musteri sahipligi -> status `teslim_edildi` kontrolu -> `order` UPDATE (`onaylandı`, `confirmed_at`) -> status dondurur: `sepet/api/panels.py:226-241`. |
| `GET /api/restaurant/earnings` | `restaurant_earnings` -> `require_restaurant` -> tum siparisler ve `onaylandı` siparisler icin iki aggregate `order` sorgusu -> Python'"'da ortalama hesaplar -> kazanc ozeti dondurur: "'`sepet/api/panels.py:247-272`. |
| `POST /api/restaurants/{restaurant_id}/reviews` | `create_review` -> `require_customer` -> yorum metni kontrolu -> `restaurant` varlik kontrolu -> `order` onaylanmis siparis kontrolu -> `restaurant_review` benzersizlik kontrolu -> `restaurant_review` INSERT -> yorum dondurur: `sepet/api/reviews.py:18-50`. |

Bazi panel akislari iki baglanti acar: biri dependency icinde, biri handler icinde; ornegin `require_restaurant` `restaurant` tablosunu ayri `get_db` cagrisinda okur ve `restaurant_orders` tekrar baglanti acar: `sepet/api/auth.py:39-48`, `sepet/api/panels.py:84-103`.

## 4. Veri Modeli

| Tablo | Kolonlar | Dokunan endpointler |
